{title: 267 - Spirit Divine}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #267 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 267}
{meta: category Holy Spirit - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]Spirit divine, [C7/Bb]attend [Am/C]our [C]prayers,
[F/C]And [C]make [Gm/D]this [F/C]house [C]Thy [Dm/A]home;
[Am]Descend [C]with [Gm]all [Am]Thy [Bb]gracious [C]powers,
[F/C]O come, [C]great Spirit, [Dm/A]come!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F]Come [E7]as [F]the light; [C7/Bb]to [Am]us reveal
[F/C]Our [C]emptiness and [Dm/A]woe,
[Am]And lead [Dm/F]us [Gm]in [Bb]those [F/C]paths [C]of [Dm/A]life
[F/C]Where-on [C]the righteous [Dm/A]go.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F]Come [E7]as [F]the fire, [C7/Bb]and [Am]purge our [C]hearts
[F/C]Like [C]sacrificial [Dm/A]flame;
[Am]Let our [C]whole [Am]soul [Bb]an [C]of - f'ring [Dm/A]be
[F/C]To our [C]Redeemer's [Dm/A]name.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[F]Come [E7]as [F]the dove, [C7/Bb]and [Am]spread Thy [C]wings,
[F/C]The wings [C]of [Gm/D]peaceful [Dm/A]love;
[Am]And let [Dm/F]Thy [Gm]church [Bb]on [F/C]earth [C]become
[F/C]Blest as [C]the church [Dm/A]above.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 5}
[F]Spirit divine, [C7/Bb]attend [Am/C]our [C]prayers,
[F/C]Make [C]a [Gm/D]lost [F/C]world [C]Thy [Dm/A]home;
[Am]Descend [C]with [Gm]all [Am]Thy [Bb]gracious [C]powers,
[F/C]O come, [C]great Spirit, [Dm/A]come!
{end_of_verse}
